shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QmcUCigNOlv88MJW_-5Tag","review_id":"BIWZJd0SQQJSzCa8DXysSQ","date":"2015-11-05T21:37:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9224958419799805,"text_excerpt":"We stopped into this neighborhood gem twice on our last visit. Halloween night the place was hopping with costumed characters and dynamite bartenders - great recommendations y'all. Second night was loaded entertainment - a freaky sideshow. There are just some things you can't unsee my friends. But good drinks, and a friendly welcoming vibe to all. Visited with the owner one night, but he didn't even recognize us the second night. C'est la vie."},{"business_id":"QmcUCigNOlv88MJW_-5Tag","review_id":"UFZq3ncAW37VRqgRxDXRMw","date":"2011-06-14T16:41:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9216434955596924,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. I totally agree with Dan R.'s review. Though it is a \"gay bar\" it has a mix of everyone. The regulars are great and they never treat a newcomer like an outsider. For a fun night just to hang with a couple of friends its great. Nonetheless if you still want to hit the Quarter you can because you are not far."},{"business_id":"QmcUCigNOlv88MJW_-5Tag","review_id":"aIf0q2xlrJRQ6fUEuQdVkQ","date":"2014-02-27T23:04:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.914664089679718,"text_excerpt":"Okay, was new to NOLA then and ended up wandering to this bar. The owner was sooo nice and so were the bartenders there! Made me feel right at home! I just needed free wifi to do my employment search and they were really cool. ;-) Hope everyone is doing well there! Thanks for the Southern Hospitality!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
